From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:16:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): bring the new-session project prompt up to its PR

Offer the project step while the project list is still loading and close it
for the plain composer when the list fails or comes back empty; hide a stale
session fetch error on the project step. More AppShell, palette and Settings
tests. Matches https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent/pull/11397.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Docs: none (fix: the project step while the project list loads, fails or is empty; the feature-map entry still holds)
---
